    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's just hard to see that when the silence is this loud. it feels more like i'm just taking up space that could be used for something else. if i was gone, it wouldn't be a tragedy, it would just be... more quiet. like a light going out in a room where no one is even watching. wouldn't it be easier for everyone if things were just peaceful and still like that?",
